&lt;td style="width: 870.921px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 42.75pt;" colspan="7" valign="top" width="654"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;KDE is organized as a Delaware limited liability company and is disregarded for Federal income tax purposes. Income taxes associated with its operations are the responsibility of its owners and would not generally be reflected in its financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.2667px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Note 3 Ownership Change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.2667px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;All of the Membership Interests in Kinetica Partners, LLC were purchased by Eckard Midstream, LLC, a Texas limited liability company, in a transaction that closed on December 27, 2023.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
